PSE is a private dialect derived from ZMeta (zmeta-event-1.0), an open
specification published under the Apache License, Version 2.0 at
https://github.com/JTC-byte/zmeta-spec. PSE does not claim upstream ZMeta
compatibility and must not be described as ZMeta-conformant. The changes from
ZMeta are documented in this repository: spec/layer-model.yaml carries the
current divergence list, and spec/divergence-register.yaml will carry the
governed register when it exists.
